    "body": "Bumps the github-actions group with 1 update in the / directory: [vmactions/freebsd-vm](https://github.com/vmactions/freebsd-vm).\n\nUpdates `vmactions/freebsd-vm` from 1.5.8 to 1.5.9\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/vmactions/freebsd-vm/releases\">vmactions/freebsd-vm's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v1.5.9</h2>\n<p>Optional key suffix for the cache-after-prepare cache</p>\n<p>New input cache-after-prepare-key-suffix: an optional value that is\nappended as-is to the cache key of the image cached after prepare.\nChanging it discards that cache and runs prepare again, without\nediting prepare itself. Requested in\n<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vmactions/freebsd-vm/issues/167\">vmactions/freebsd-vm#167</a></p>\n<h2>Usage</h2>\n<pre><code>  - uses: actions/checkout@v7\r\n  - uses: vmactions/freebsd-vm@v1\r\n    with:\r\n      cache-after-prepare: true\r\n      cache-after-prepare-key-suffix: deps-${{ hashFiles('deps.sh') }}\r\n      prepare: |\r\n        sh deps.sh\r\n<p></code></pre></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The input is optional and empty by default. Left out, every cache\nkey stays the same as in v1.5.8, so existing caches stay valid.</li>\n<li>The prepare script and the sync method are still part of the key;\nthe suffix is only added at the end.</li>\n<li>hashFiles() is evaluated on the runner, relative to the workspace,\nso check out first. It returns an empty string when no file\nmatches, and the key then no longer follows the file.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Pins</h2>\n<p>BUILDER_VERSION  2.2.8 (unchanged)\nANYVM_VERSION    0.7.2 (unchanged)</p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/vmactions/freebsd-vm/commit/c46abacb49f09938ca4e1702d15d836285d694cc\"><code>c46abac</code></a> Update vmactions/freebsd-vm from base-vm</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/vmactions/freebsd-vm/commit/83496ce7f422693d9548bc2424c271f368dfb55c\"><code>83496ce</code></a> Generated from base-vm</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/vmactions/freebsd-vm/commit/abc5072be0695ffe8e18fffea5c458d727eb9ebd\"><code>abc5072</code></a> Sync from base-builder</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/vmactions/freebsd-vm/commit/c6d9b096aedae82f7bf19a48050512479ebc0bad\"><code>c6d9b09</code></a> Update vmactions/freebsd-vm from base-vm</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/vmactions/freebsd-vm/commit/6d69158878e0eb9cca48d8542c621bc8692760f5\"><code>6d69158</code></a> Generated from base-vm</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/vmactions/freebsd-vm/commit/d1c0bc5c7b8f22bf414f780b6950731c93dbbc1c\"><code>d1c0bc5</code></a> Update version to v1.5.8</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/vmactions/freebsd-vm/commit/6f16425165df853ea028efa4306b103a535ec74b\"><code>6f16425</code></a> Update vmactions/freebsd-vm from base-vm</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/vmactions/freebsd-vm/commit/6f0e5ed0f380470e94e62ec8b1733beec412bb89\"><code>6f0e5ed</code></a> Generated from base-vm</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/vmactions/freebsd-vm/commit/eec490ec4ec3da1cfc5d9cecc9654d118f654570\"><code>eec490e</code></a> Update vmactions/freebsd-vm from base-vm</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/vmactions/freebsd-vm/commit/40859e13ca4d682e4a6521083d1fecdd459aac4c\"><code>40859e1</code></a> Generated from base-vm</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a href=\"https://github.com/vmactions/freebsd-vm/compare/a2f9a41fa97f6848b8c3b791087dfcdaa5b473ff...c46abacb49f09938ca4e1702d15d836285d694cc\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n",
